From 7fd2b66db20daabb26ad31395a7b006ea698dbb8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arena Agent <agent@arena.ai>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 03:07:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make companion requests, circle saves and profile photos
 reach the website

- Companion requests: accept, reject and cancel now record their answer
  ("approved" / "rejected" / "cancelled") on the companionship_request
  notification the other member received. Before, it stayed "pending" and
  Approve / Reject reappeared after a reload.
- Followers / Following: FollowDto carries Country and City so the cards
  can show the member's location.
- Circles: PhotoUrl is no longer capped at 1024 characters (uploaded
  covers are data URLs). Create / update validate name (120), description
  (500), icon (60), colour (20) and photo (PNG/JPEG/GIF/WebP, 1 MB) and
  answer 400 with a message instead of failing the insert.
- Profile / message-book comments: ProfilePhotoUrl (uploaded photo) is
  used when no photo is stored in the database, instead of only the
  external picture URL.
